{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1000_p", "source_sha256": "11e0b0a7dc1242caf8a2c9f1bb9fd1819c004cf068ffa52e1c5b3bd1c7fb47ef", "ja": "（美也と真のドラマ撮影は着々と進んでおり……\n美也の印象的なシーンも、無事に撮り終わった！）", "zh": "（美也和真参与的电视剧拍摄顺利进行着……\n美也那场令人印象深刻的戏，也顺利拍完了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b371db95d1de04fa10624ca4fd9916a381e88fdc9fe6b05af291e02d8fffb40c", "ja": "お疲れ様、美也！　すごくいい演技だったよ。\nぬいぐるみを抱いて、うっとりするところとか……。", "zh": "辛苦了，美也！演得非常好。比如抱着玩偶、陶醉其中的那一幕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "be982087b43e1d94da34771496e9ea229b02cba5cdc45c23c89d346b226f98aa", "ja": "ボクも、かなり惹きこまれたよ！\nあのシーンは、思わずゾクッとしちゃったな。", "zh": "我也完全被吸引进去了！\n那个场景让我不由得打了个寒颤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "93c81902a2b6a2a73b3c5d405b992ca3146d102f304ba588a5c773405b3b2125", "ja": "それはよかったです～。たくさん練習をしたので、\nその成果が出たようですな～♪", "zh": "那真是太好了～。因为练习了很多次，看来努力终于有所成果了呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "94d456908ab8ea730e0a4b63e2e7a8ed0bbad7c0e4df5d3122d41a111b820947", "ja": "演技レッスンの時、頑張ってたもんね。もしかして、\nレッスン以外にも、何か練習をしてたの？", "zh": "演技课的时候，你一直很努力嘛。难道说，除了上课以外，你还练习了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "cd6aa69e8dc1920120267304d6b2dd6fd813c6da49f18c964090d9af7e04ebee", "ja": "うふふ、自主練を少々～。でも上手くいったのは、\nマコトさん2号の存在が大きかったと思います～。", "zh": "呵呵呵，稍微自主练习了一下～。不过我觉得能顺利进行，\n主要还是多亏了真小姐2号的存在～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1006_p", "source_sha256": "bfef454ea1bd138065372c7e8d26913e9946db51ea796f2d8bcf47053bbcc271", "ja": "マコトさん……。", "zh": "真……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "e2fad9b4828aa2b142d54a55348ef95f476c6e1f4563db8701dd69548c23c260", "ja": "2号……？", "zh": "2号……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "ac3cdeb9965e8a42ba8424b07ea9b631ebbc71489586c8c98674fd70d849b948", "ja": "はい～。お買い物に行った時、凛々しいお顔をした\nふわふわなウサギのぬいぐるみを見つけたんです～。", "zh": "是的～我去买东西的时候，发现了一个表情英气、毛茸茸的兔子玩偶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "5d0c9e030c0db8bc5a148c034ab097c2472dea65146dc0fba1d93365365698da", "ja": "真さんに雰囲気が似ているなと思って。それで\nお家にお招きして、練習相手になってもらいました～。", "zh": "我觉得它的气质和真小姐很像。所以就把它请到家里，让它陪我练习了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0ca34b736d56dacc4f895ed7bfd8af2615638c3a7976e28ebc7fb4a0cc6c17a0", "ja": "なるほどな。代役を立てての自主練か……。\nいい演技が出来たのも納得だな！", "zh": "原来如此。找人代替自己进行自主练习吗……。\n难怪能演得这么好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "1567d62983fba410042cd9d3db88802207174cd8077b718ca0b27220b09aa5e8", "ja": "へえ～。ボクに似てるウサギかぁ……。ねえ、美也？\nそのぬいぐるみの写真、今度見せてくれない？", "zh": "哦～，和我很像的兔子啊……。呐，美也？\n下次能让我看看那只毛绒玩偶的照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "3b267daa1169fa7bfd88d893b4ee14aafe649ed52e0142dfcee65c988914b492", "ja": "写真より実物の方が、かわいいですよ～。控え室で\nお留守番してるので、あとで見せてあげますね。", "zh": "实物比照片更可爱哦～。它正在休息室里看家，待会儿给你看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "d07d362c9d74ed6d30b4f8f78c2778ac0475a36d21f33f32b983884b1b97d507", "ja": "あっ！　もしかして、あの大きなカバン！？\n何が入ってるのか、気にはなってたけど……。", "zh": "啊！难道是那个大包！？  \n我一直挺在意里面装的是什么，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "2d59f77a48b5f41fc4ab856a7e41869a7b3d1967d22db616e4aebfa68888db08", "ja": "はい～。マコトさん2号は、いつも一緒ですから。\n肌身離さず過ごすようにしてたんですよ～。", "zh": "是的～。真小姐2号一直都和我在一起嘛。\n所以我一直都随身带着呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c4a698faefbd555f67fbe1e972a93413c3e133c3fdbe6f86f12a82299ca66d11", "ja": "おお……。役に慣れるためだからな。\nでも、いつも一緒といっても……。", "zh": "哦……毕竟是为了熟悉角色嘛。\n不过，就算说是一直在一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "c3cf65d64651fa0cde8453a37d236911162af926247a6dc4534e03cfa4b9bbdb", "ja": "お出かけも、ごはんのときも一緒で……それから眠って\nしまうまで、ずっとおしゃべりもしてたんですよ～。", "zh": "一起出门、一起吃饭……然后直到睡着之前，也一直在聊天呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "60539145a6761297bd3f94c19a0eef58aa6462d71193eab4588e1202427069c3", "ja": "愛の深さを表現するために始めた練習ですが、\nマコトさん2号との生活はとっても楽しかったです～。", "zh": "虽然这是为了表现爱的深度而开始的练习，不过，和真小姐2号一起生活真的特别开心～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "1dea129ce4a59029fa2e61ffa82b4d586093c84bdebcfc27f01449f9290b18d8", "ja": "そこまでしてたの！？　だからあれだけの迫力が……。\nい、いろんな意味でゾクッとしたよ！　あ、あははっ。", "zh": "你居然做到这种程度！？难怪会有那么强的气势……  \n不、不过真是让人从各种意义上都打了个寒颤！啊、啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0394_1019_p", "source_sha256": "34dd2d1927f612707ad5e236a70bf79314fe4ff0eb9080ef51e13666ad43f586", "ja": "（美也の努力のおかげで、いいシーンになったのは\n確かだ。あとでマコトさん2号に挨拶しないとな！）", "zh": "（多亏了美也的努力，确实拍出了很棒的场景。之后还得去向真小姐2号打个招呼才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
